[<OLI>SBS Cap Sheet:  [<RID>ASTM D6162/D6162M</RID>][ or ][<RID>ASTM D6164/D6164M</RID>] Type[ I][ or][ II][ or][ III], Grade [G][S], <HLS>minimum<MET> [3.7 mm]</MET><ENG> [145 mils]</ENG> [_____] 
thick</HLS>, and as required to provide specified fire safety rating.</OLI><BRK/>
