<SPT><TTL><SUB>Modified Bitumen Roof Cement</SUB></TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT><RID>ASTM D4586/D4586M</RID>, Type II for vertical surfaces, Type I for horizontal surfaces, compatible with the modified bitumen roof membrane and as recommended 
by the modified bitumen membrane manufacturer.</TXT><BRK/>
