]<SPT><TTL>Membrane Liner</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide self-adhering modified bitumen underlayment conforming to <RID>ASTM D1970/D1970M</RID>, EPDM membrane liner conforming to <RID>ASTM D4637/D4637M</RID>, or other 
waterproof membrane liner material as approved by the Manufacturer.</TXT><BRK/>
